# server/Dockerfile is built with the repo root as context, so the root
# /.dockerignore is the file docker actually reads. This copy is kept in sync
# for builders that resolve the ignore file next to the Dockerfile instead.
# It must NOT exclude shims/*/src|scripts|Dockerfile: those are bundled into
# the orchestrator image as build contexts for the shim self build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.smoke-work

.git
.github
.kilo
android
data
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.env.*
